[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888642050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104371#issuecomment-2888642050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104371","id":2888642050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLS4C","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T23:46:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T23:46:57Z","body":"I think it makes sense, though we uncovered some weird glitches with the bezier edit button remaining disabled when adding new bezier tracks, so there might be other larger issues surrounding the bezier edit button that we should look at and make sure we don't make it worse.\r\n\r\nAs for testing... I reviewed in a call with Saracen, Tokage and iFire. I think it seems reasonable if going from one animation with beziers to another animation with beziers, but I want to make sure it doesn't break other cases so I need help testing.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to provide an MRP or test project? I work in 3D and there's no way to import bezier tracks so I don't have anything to work with for testing this change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888642050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890679834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104371#issuecomment-2890679834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104371","id":2890679834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sTEYa","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T11:35:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T11:35:30Z","body":"> Would it be possible to provide an MRP or test project? I work in 3D and there's no way to import bezier tracks so I don't have anything to work with for testing this change.\r\n\r\nYou should be able to just manually key some random property of some node, even in 3D, and check the \"Use Bezier Curves\" option when it asks if you want to create a new track.\r\n\r\nI don't have the project used in the video shown above, but here's another project that